# Kotlin / Spring Boot microservices

- Clean Architecture: domain (no Spring/JPA) → application → infrastructure → api
- Database per service; no cross-service SQL
- DTOs at HTTP boundaries; constructor injection; `@Transactional` on application services only
- JWT resource server on every service; clients call the gateway only
- Distributed sagas via outbox events; compensating actions; no 2PC
- Unit tests MockK; integration tests Testcontainers
- `./gradlew test` before done; no secrets in repo
